    [
     1,
     "Hi all, just updated the <a href=\"http://rapache.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rapache.net/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239600760000&amp;usg=AOvVaw172I8H3BWYg9xQPtL6oMdc\">website</a> with release 1.2.3. The most important feature is the addition of the function setStatus. From the manual:<div><br></div><div><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:HelveticaNeue,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:21px\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><h4 style=\"margin:0px 0px 4px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:Georgia,&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;line-height:30px\">\r\n4.8 <a title=\"Back to top\" href=\"http://rapache.net/manual.html#top\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);outline:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rapache.net/manual.html%23top&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239600761000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wBKOWSbFpqDPc9BcRfoyb\">setStatus</a></h4><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\nAllows handlers to set the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_HTTP_status_codes\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);outline:0px;line-height:inherit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_HTTP_status_codes&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239600761000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ph38Ihm-MURoSFxv6TxxA\">HTTP Status code</a> for the response.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><pre style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(222,222,222);font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;line-height:1.3em;background-color:rgb(244,244,244)\">\r\nsetStatus(status=200L)\r\n</pre><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Arguments:</p><ul style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:none outside\">\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:18px\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51)\">status</strong> integer.</li>\r\n</ul><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Returns:</p><ul style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:none outside\">\r\n<li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 10px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:18px\">logical vector. TRUE if successsfull, FALSE on failure.</li></ul></div></b></b></b><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\nYou can have handlers create custom HTTP error responses by using the <b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">setStatus()</b> function. For instance, here&#39;s an example that sends a custom message for 500 &quot;Internal Server Error&quot;:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid rgb(222,222,222);font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;line-height:1.3em;background-color:rgb(244,244,244)\">\r\nhandler &lt;- function() {\r\n   setContentType(&quot;text/plain&quot;)\r\n   setStatus(500L)\r\n   cat(&quot;Hi, I&#39;m a &#39;Fail Ale&#39;!\\n&quot;)\r\n   OK\r\n}\r\n</pre><h3 style=\"margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:Georgia,&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;line-height:34px\">\r\n<a name=\"m_-8420109841653309330_License\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration:underline;outline:0px\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><br></h3></b></b></b><h3 style=\"margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:Georgia,&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;line-height:34px\">\r\n<b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:HelveticaNeue,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:21px\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:HelveticaNeue,&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:21px\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><b style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><h3 style=\"margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(24,24,24);font-family:Georgia,&#39;Times New Roman&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:normal;line-height:34px;display:inline!important\">\r\n6.2 <a title=\"Back to top\" href=\"http://rapache.net/manual.html#top\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);outline:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rapache.net/manual.html%23top&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239600761000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wBKOWSbFpqDPc9BcRfoyb\">Custom Error Messages</a></h3></b></b></b></b></b></b></b><br>\r\n<a name=\"m_-8420109841653309330_rapache_Variables\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration:underline;outline:0px\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a></h3></div>\r\n"
    ]
